  "body": "<div data-page-id=\"Fv6NdhdF6obLhNxUnkmcADwbnNb\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgQedMquQoiM6ixKyTackwAnnPc\">Since Firmware V3.3.2, we have introduced the brand-new word processor, Text Notes. In this article, you will learn more about the interface and tools of the Text Notes.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BsSQdkIgios4w6xQrkEcysu0nOg\"> </div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FIgadgSCaok6EixOw5hcoeqQnye\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"a29d75e7-5246-4472-8256-e92118f74c59\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBOWBbjcHnotNcBx2HONcf4d9n3d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"BOWBbjcHnotNcBx2HONcf4d9n3d\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":79561,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196337780884\" alt=\"10.2-1.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qm0ydQ2cYooKmOxuUg2c9N0anFh\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UE2OdekU8oiMYkxqjWzcD9fBn6D\"><strong>Undo &amp; Redo</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OsuGdCqUEoaGsaxuEkGcWr2hnEy\">Here you can tap the Undo button to move one step back, or tap the Redo button to move one step forward.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TeUOdMwkqokkq0xApDjcfnZYnqd\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SgAado2o4oISgexMzFec38JunMf\"><strong>Style</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-P0Y6dOuQ6o4WKYxoLzUcIHv8nkf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"6971a76a-7a9d-478c-80fd-c25803da6d00\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHM1IbRS2fohLP1xYJiacw92bnUb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"HM1IbRS2fohLP1xYJiacw92bnUb\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":91479,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196326254228\" alt=\"10.2-2.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DSsOdmIGioSI8Qx87yPcHyDgnjg\">Here you can adjust the font, font size, or color of the text, or set the text to bold, italic, or underlined.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q8M0dO06CoYqaMxu6vCciDmwnRb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Js66dequGowm6ExWA3ncgfhXnmh\"><strong>Format</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-EGK2d0sEYowgkYxc52qcjwVXnAd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"119d8689-6508-40b5-b5c3-63d28c0ea7a5\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FI0qzbnTBsoZEQ4x1E7YcNFbGnDc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"I0qzbnTBsoZEQ4x1E7YcNFbGnDc\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":98556,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196326050196\" alt=\"10.2-3.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DYq6d4mW0ouuWgxmmp4cJsaIn5e\">Here you can apply the format of Body or Headings of different levels to the text.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UiiMdyG0uo88UaxcPWmcXF4rnef\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OgYydYyi8ouk0SxMR0CcXccinLf\"><strong>Spacing</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MGcQdi6aGoIWUYxshF0cWbtCnAh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"e079c26d-6478-4df6-8647-fab0b1cf8ad5\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKbn8bVGKroWhnVx8kHrcL612nHc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"Kbn8bVGKroWhnVx8kHrcL612nHc\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":103249,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196337591828\" alt=\"10.2-4.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cuymdqm6GoeSeixmWPpctqqnnGe\">Here you can adjust the line spacing, word spacing, or margins of the page.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUSKd2yiUos6Mmxg6Tuc6gaXnwx\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xqwod64kYoUAqgxU7eHc0tSIncf\"><strong>Align</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-GcEkduO0WoS648xs1MQcUK32nbp\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"d5cec57b-1e23-4a81-8472-3a66dbaa2e04\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUzZtb9b2poKryExJgAycQmSnnbh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"UzZtb9b2poKryExJgAycQmSnnbh\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":93916,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196326101140\" alt=\"10.2-5.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R4gcdQ40Yo2emgx8DxochEJWnfg\">Here you can set the paragraph to left-aligned, centered, right-aligned, and increase or reduce the indentation.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UoYSdAeweoGIEkxKSFxcXc92n5f\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Amk2dMkKGoUmGoxo7kAcxqh2nxg\"><strong>List</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Dw8qdaUOkoCco3xcL43cNrthnwd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"9412007a-07db-4562-a540-a31505fd28d5\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVxHWbc5wcoqWQhxPe4Qc11iEnrc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"VxHWbc5wcoqWQhxPe4Qc11iEnrc\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":91949,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196337644820\" alt=\"10.2-6.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YeugdGguiooYW8xsbsfcnfhin1b\">Here you can create a checklist, bulleted, or numbered list with different styles.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GO8mdQ28WoMaYexUFOscoVwKnag\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HqsGd0eMkou6g8x6VZPceakunGd\"><strong>Insert</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YMAYdUWmgoC0oyxa8n2crEdonhq\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"81ad34fd-1f46-49f2-bc7c-4f6527118a38\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FO7QubVR7EoMprxxxqzLc3JJInWd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"O7QubVR7EoMprxxxqzLc3JJInWd\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":88405,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196326172180\" alt=\"10.2-7.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GIMGdwUIAo0GYIxUTpGcY2ASn2c\">Here you can insert links to websites, images or attachments.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMAid0KgEoWsmSxqk9RcS8e4nmc\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RgI6diKQCoyoyCxYrW6cvKX7nYd\"><strong>Record</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DkiGdykoCoiMYox6ZnAc9z1qnYe\">Here you can create an audio recording with the microphone. Then the recording will be pinned on your canvas. After the recording is finished, you can play back, delete, export, or share the recording.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M0iOdysWYoQGCExyWkIcE2K8n5g\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEsgdEOymo60mqxMHpJcolVnn5d\"><strong>Export</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RaeYdgGSmoQEomxaWwQcE6mxnge\">Here you can export the file to TXT/.note format and share the note with others.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4ocdq2C2oUckCxMhoUct2Tyn7b\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z8gOdYAIuoyCcwx4YGvcK0eNnlc\"><strong>Search</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VKoGde6MsoU2woxcPCfcnPGjnGb\">Here you can search or replace your text for a specific keyword.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWOudKwOOocisKx29pNcHMCanNe\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UuiQdsSAOoKeC2x6fDlcRIAIn7b\"><strong>Sync</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TemedgmqUokuy4x4yxFcZ2cFnYh\">Here you can sync your note to the cloud after logging in to your ONYX account.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqIqdgI8qoWMGUxgTfnc03WKnNe\"> </div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V6KsdwiIwoYgWCxysHvc0swznwb\"><strong>More</strong></div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-TCUGdY2aSo84cux4x3McTMELnof\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json='{\"items\":[{\"uuid\":\"ca5df733-33b6-45e0-93ff-131bf16f0da0\",\"height\":400,\"width\":960,\"currHeight\":400,\"currWidth\":960,\"natrualHeight\":400,\"natrualWidth\":960,\"pluginName\":\"imageUpload\",\"scale\":1,\"src\":\"https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWI2ZbewrlomxFBxhTNEckIxQnQM%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16\",\"file_token\":\"WI2ZbewrlomxFBxhTNEckIxQnQM\",\"image_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":90204,\"comments\":[]}]}'><img src=\"https://booxsupport.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/15196326187540\" alt=\"10.2-8.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0sOd4oKSoCsuWxo9hpceFNrnMd\">\n<strong>Save: </strong>Saves the note manually.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WuI2degkuo8UsUxymgYcZGHcnId\">\n<strong>Control: </strong>Here you can enable / disable various touch settings including the System Bar, Bottom Gestures, and Side Gestures to avoid accidental touches by the palm.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OcSsdiGoMoSG26xcPpich3TTnDb\">\n<strong>Clear Format:</strong> Completely clears the format of the text.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YSIsduKWUo48UqxsTS2cDowOnGw\">\n<strong>Customize Toolbar:</strong> Here you can add or remove tools in the sidebar, or enable / disable text display below each icon.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LCWWdassmoO4QUx8bHNc1pmAnBd\"> </div>\n</div>"
}
